  rdfs:comment "mobilityDCAT-AP is a mobility-related extension of the DCAT application profile for data portals in Europe DCAT-AP v3.0.0. It allows for a structured, interoperable and harmonised way to describe and exchange metadata about data platforms and datasets with a mobility relevance."@en ;
  rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/> ;
