                <https://semiceu.github.io/GeoDCAT-AP/releases/> .			   
		   

###  http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel
skos:prefLabel rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:comment """For Location, it refers to a preferred label of the location.
    This property can be repeated for parallel language versions of the label - see 12. Accessibility and Multilingual Aspects.
    This property corresponds to the addition by geoDCAT-AP v3.0.0.

    For Concept, it refers to a preferred label of the concept.
    This property can be repeated for parallel language versions of the label - see 12. Accessibility and Multilingual Aspects."""@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "In mobilityDCAT-AP, this is an optional property to be used for Location, and a mandatory property to be used for Concept."@en ;
    vs:term_status "stable" ;
